{"id": "EUVD-2026-98930", "enisaUuid": "61828066-ed88-348f-9af0-8da4ac77c0b4", "description": "Ikaros 1.2.0 through 1.2.5 contains an authentication bypass vulnerability that allows attackers with a valid password to skip TOTP verification by reusing the login temp token. Attackers can present the temp token from the jwt/apply endpoint as a bearer JWT, refresh it, or use HTTP Basic login to gain full account access, including the master administrator.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T16:53:02", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T15:42:16", "baseScore": 8.6, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/ikaros-2fa-bypass-temp-token", "https://github.com/ikaros-dev/ikaros/blob/v1.2.5/server/src/main/java/run/ikaros/server/security/authentication/jwt/JwtAuthenticationProvider.java#L57-L112", "https://github.com/ikaros-dev/ikaros/blob/v1.2.5/server/src/main/java/run/ikaros/server/security/authentication/jwt/JwtAuthenticationFilter.java#L30-L46", "https://github.com/ikaros-dev/ikaros/blob/v1.2.5/server/src/main/java/run/ikaros/server/security/SecurityEndpoint.java#L80-L118", "https://github.com/ikaros-dev/ikaros/releases/tag/v1.2.5", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/ikaros-1.2.0-through-1.2.5-totp-authentication-bypass-via-temp-token"], "aliases": ["GHSA-hj5g-wfrp-6x6g", "CVE-2026-110097"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.43, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "22894645-20b5-368f-8b0d-80d3d9edfdb1", "product": {"name": "ikaros", "vendor": {"name": "ikaros-dev"}}, "product_version": "1.2.0 \u22641.2.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "0acf683c-5ce5-3af9-bebc-1f48f8bbc49e", "vendor": {"name": "ikaros-dev"}}], "isExploited": false}